-<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hans"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>PHI OS · 唯一 MASTER HUMAN REVIEW</title><style>body{font:16px/1.6 system-ui;margin:0;background:#f6f3eb;color:#18242c}main{max-width:1500px;margin:auto;padding:32px}section{background:white;padding:24px;margin:24px 0;border:1px solid #d3c8b1}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{border:1px solid #d3c8b1;padding:10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}pre,td{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}small{display:block}a{color:#155178}h1,h2{color:#153a4c}</style><style id="review-table-mobile-containment">body,main{overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word;white-space:normal}table{display:block;max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box}</style><main><!-- REPORT-VISUAL-CONVERGENCE-R21:BEGIN --><section id="REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2-1" class="r21"><style>.r21{background:#f5f1e8;color:#17333e;padding:24px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.r21 *{box-sizing:border-box}.r21 table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}.r21 td,.r21 th{border:1px solid #b5a67e;padding:8px;text-align:left}.r21 img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.r21-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr));gap:12px}.r21 figure{margin:0}.r21 code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.r21 a{color:#066b6f}</style><h1>Report Visual Convergence R2.1</h1><p><strong>LOCAL HUMAN_REVIEW_READY WITH BLOCKERS · PARTIAL</strong> · 2026-10-26。本文是最新接续；下方 R2 历史限制记录保留。前置页明确为P01–P05，没有P06。</p><p>固定前置页／固定章首页：只呈现批准图稿，无动态叠字。客户正文：按选择语言，使用对应BODY背景；续页保留背景。八字继续动态章首页。BODY与SECTION-STYLE不可互换。</p><div style="overflow:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Report</th><th>Architecture</th><th>Local result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>BZR</td><td>DYNAMIC</td><td>DYNAMIC_LOGIC_VERIFIED / BODY_PUBLIC_404</td></tr><tr><td>AST</td><td>FIXED</td><td>LOCAL_FULL_NATIVE_CANDIDATE_VERIFIED</td></tr><tr><td>ZWR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>FIXED_MAP_COMPLETE / ONE_PUBLIC_ASSET_UNAVAILABLE</td></tr><tr><td>PROFILE</td><td>FIXED</td><td>FIXED_15_VERIFIED / BODY_BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ECR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>FIXED_MAP_COMPLETE / TWO_PUBLIC_ASSETS_UNAVAILABLE</td></tr><tr><td>NUM</td><td>FIXED</td><td>PENDING_APPROVAL</td></tr><tr><td>HD</td><td>FIXED</td><td>PENDING_APPROVAL</td></tr><tr><td>CROSS</td><td>FIXED</td><td>PENDING_APPROVAL</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>实际读取与清单</h2><p>Owner清单66个精确对象，63个真实下载解码；ECR SEC05／SEC07、Ziwei SEC08的公开URL返回404，仍标记DASHBOARD_CONFIRMED_API_UNVERIFIED。管理API原401独立保留，本轮未读取或修改凭证。不是用401判断资产不存在。</p><p>另核验原批准BODY：Financial200且摘要一致；Personal Evidence与BaZi旧地址404。PE15张固定图均通过，但含正文R2.1导出会拒绝缺失BODY。Tarot／I Ching和未来三类未擅自编造BODY。</p><h2>真实PDF与BODY续页</h2><p>八份新PDF117页。AST完整原生候选64页＝15固定＋49正文；所有原正文／图表／分页器保留。其余是明确的固定页集或正文摘录，不能视为完整报告。ECR7页和Ziwei4页正文／续页均有实际BODY物理页验证。人审仍需评价可读性和固定图细字；没有以机器PASS代替接受。</p><ul><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/profile-fixed-only.pdf">profile-fixed-only · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 44.84MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/ecr-fixed-only.pdf">ecr-fixed-only · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 33.90MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/zwr-fixed-only.pdf">zwr-fixed-only · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 36.37MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/ast-native-fixed-and-body.pdf">ast-native-fixed-and-body · PDF</a> — 完整本地原生候选 · 41.29MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/ecr-body-en.pdf">ecr-body-en · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 3.50MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/ecr-body-zh-Hans.pdf">ecr-body-zh-Hans · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 3.58MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/ecr-body-bilingual.pdf">ecr-body-bilingual · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 3.60MiB</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r21/ziwei-existing-body-pages.pdf">ziwei-existing-body-pages · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 4.11MiB</li></ul><p>这些大图PDF超过现有本地私有缓存1MiB限制；未解除该限制、未宣称生产签名交付已准入。原R1.2签名下载与撤销另行复跑通过。</p><div class="r21-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/profile-fixed-only-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/profile-fixed-only-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 profile-fixed-only"></a><figcaption>profile-fixed-only · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ast-native-fixed-and-body-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ast-native-fixed-and-body-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ast-native-fixed-and-body"></a><figcaption>ast-native-fixed-and-body · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ecr-body-bilingual-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ecr-body-bilingual-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ecr-body-bilingual"></a><figcaption>ecr-body-bilingual · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ziwei-existing-body-pages-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ziwei-existing-body-pages-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ziwei-existing-body-pages"></a><figcaption>ziwei-existing-body-pages · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure></div><h2>手机／桌面与三语言</h2><p>PE／ECR三种内容语言共享同一套固定图key与字节；不强制双语正文。ECR中文、英文、双语BODY摘录实际渲染；PE因BODY不可读取，三语言完整PDF不作PASS。AST保留原获准双语正文模式，不擅自增加其他模式。</p><div class="r21-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ecr-body-en-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ecr-body-en-390.png" alt="实际浏览器 final-ecr-body-en-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-ecr-body-en-390.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ecr-body-zh-Hans-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ecr-body-zh-Hans-390.png" alt="实际浏览器 final-ecr-body-zh-Hans-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-ecr-body-zh-Hans-390.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ast-native-fixed-and-body-1440.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ast-native-fixed-and-body-1440.png" alt="实际浏览器 final-ast-native-fixed-and-body-1440.png"></a><figcaption>final-ast-native-fixed-and-body-1440.png</figcaption></figure></div><h2>本次重新执行的检查</h2><p>181项R2.1检查、原120项断言、44项接收检查、66项浏览器断言通过；原11份PDF104页已在隔离目录复跑。12项相关编译和实际Pages Functions编译通过。旧测试／冻结hash／R1.2历史回执没有被改成新PASS。完整静态发布build未运行。</p><div style="overflow:auto"><table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Status</th><th>Boundary</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A_BODY</td><td>PARTIAL</td><td>AST49/ECR7/ZWR4 physical BODY pages verified; PE BODY404; BaZi old BODY404; other existing report mappings remain separately classified</td></tr><tr><td>B_FIXED</td><td>PARTIAL</td><td>Four exact owner sequences registered: PE15 AST15 real complete fixed resources; ECR13/15 ZWR14/15 real resources. No dynamic overlays.</td></tr><tr><td>C_LANGUAGE</td><td>PARTIAL</td><td>PE/ECR exact fixed keys across three content modes tested; ECR body zh/en/bilingual real rendered; PE customer-body render refuses unavailable BODY.</td></tr><tr><td>D_BAZI</td><td>PASS_LOCAL_LOGIC</td><td>Existing dynamic section regression passed; no layou