ain exact mapping; no guessed fallback.</td><td>Mapping PASS<br>Public BLOCKED<br>PDF BLOCKED_COMPLETE_REPORT<br>Private BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ZWR</td><td><code>images/reports/ziwei/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ZIWEI-SEC-08-PRESSURE-VULNERABILITY.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/ziwei/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ZIWEI-SEC-08-PRESSURE-VULNERABILITY.webp">https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/ziwei/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-ZIWEI-SEC-08-PRESSURE-VULNERABILITY.webp</a></td><td>404 → 200<br>529302 bytes</td><td>Now readable at identical approved key; Last-Modified 2026-10-26 11:52:21Z. Prior delivery failure cause not proven.<br>Activate exact verified SEC08 in existing manifest; add approved BODY to native closing; reduce R2 English top whitespace 9mm→6mm. No copy/font-size changes.</td><td>Mapping PASS<br>Public PASS<br>PDF PASS_LOCAL_68_PAGES<br>Private BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>BZR</td><td><code>images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp</code><br><a href="https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp">https://pub-1967bc5812ee4164b19a806fb1427021.r2.dev/images/reports/bazi/editorial/shared/VIS-REPORT-BAZI-BODY.webp</a></td><td>旧诊断URL无效，撤回 → 200<br>225290 bytes</td><td>Prior R21 body-read.mjs prepended public base to an already absolute approved URL; exact native configured URL reads 200. Product URL unchanged.<br>Correct diagnostic classification only; existing native mapping retained.</td><td>Mapping PASS<br>Public PASS<br>PDF PASS_BODY_DIAGNOSTIC_ONLY_NATIVE_DYNAMIC_REGRESSION_PASS<br>Private BLOCKED</td></tr></table><p>URL公共基址由现有 resolver/registry固定；未发现可据此改绑的已验证替代URL。未读取管理凭证，未重试旧401。三个404均无Location、Age、CF-Cache-Status，带查询参数仍404：不证明不存在，也不证明需要purge。对象清单权威保留为 Owner Dashboard transcription，当前独立对象管理验证仍缺。</p><h4>实际PDF与画面</h4><ul><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-bilingual.pdf">bazi-body-diagnostic-bilingual.pdf</a>：4页，1441639 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-bilingual-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-en.pdf">bazi-body-diagnostic-en.pdf</a>：4页，1403603 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-en-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-zh-Hans.pdf">bazi-body-diagnostic-zh-Hans.pdf</a>：4页，1456750 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/bazi-body-diagnostic-zh-Hans-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li><li><a href="/output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/r22/ziwei-native-fixed-and-body.pdf">ziwei-native-fixed-and-body.pdf</a>：68页，44198197 bytes；BODY逐页栅格失败0。<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/ziwei-native-fixed-and-body-pages.png">全页缩略图</a></li></ul><p>Zi Wei完整性仅指现有批准内容的本地原生渲染；未授予客户发布/语义新增接受。BaZi四页合成诊断明确标注，不替代原生报告。AST原64页及PE15固定页、ECR三语言BODY证据按文件SHA复用，未重造或改写页数。</p><h4>私有交付：BLOCKED</h4><p>11项实际安全检查：已有真实小PDF（83,527 bytes）经现有加密runtime_artifacts保存、15分钟账户绑定header grant、重复下载字节一致、错误账户/过期/来源撤销拒绝、失败恢复；大PDF通过真实renderer响应交给原helper后，被1MiB guard正确拒绝且不留下半成品。没有放宽上限，也没有把个人PDF放入公开R2。</p><p>现有PRIVATE_REPORTS绑定可供已批准released-report owner使用，但它依赖其原有release/consent/专业报告投影，并非本轮PE视觉PDF的已准入写入通道。R2模板亦需与LOCAL-PDF-R1.2缓存身份隔离。Workers官方限制为128MB/isolate，响应body无固定上限；当前arrayBuffer→base64→加密/JSON多副本不能凭文件小于128MB就判定安全。需复用现有私有owner完成流式/大文件、权限撤销、并发内存和故障恢复的本地等效证明，才可改为PRIVATE_DELIVERY_PASS。</p><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/">Workers官方限制</a> · <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/platform/limits/">R2官方限制</a>。R2单对象容量并非目前阻断；应用1MiB guard与尚未准入的集成才是当前阻断。</p><h4>测试与源码</h4><p>183项R22、44接收、120项R1.2隔离复跑与BaZi动态回归通过；既有66项浏览器/11小PDF的未受影响证据按摘要复用。Functions编译结果见下方运行记录，不使用整站build替代视觉验收。</p><p>继承runner恢复历史输出时发生UNKNOWN文件错误；七份生成证据文件变化已隔离列出。后获明确限定授权，逐份确认仅为运行时间／合成reading ID变化，备份并恢复至本轮开始的HEAD准确字节：7/7恢复、0跳过。原自动审批拒绝记录保留为历史。原历史测试与冻结hash未改。第二次120项运行将所有输出写入隔离目录，成功且不覆盖旧回执。</p><ul><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/ASSET-DELIVERY-MATRIX.json">ASSET-DELIVERY-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PUBLIC-DIAGNOSTICS.json">PUBLIC-DIAGNOSTICS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PRIVATE-DELIVERY.json">PRIVATE-DELIVERY.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PDF-INSPECTION-R22.json">PDF-INSPECTION-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/BROWSER-PDF-R22.json">BROWSER-PDF-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/TESTS-R22.json">TESTS-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/R22-SOURCE-CHANGES.json">R22-SOURCE-CHANGES.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/REUSED-PDF-EVIDENCE.json">REUSED-PDF-EVIDENCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PRESERVATION.json">PRESERVATION.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/RECEIPT-RECOVERY-STATUS.json">RECEIPT-RECOVERY-STATUS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/CURRENT-WORKTREE.log">CURRENT-WORKTREE.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/EXECUTION-STATE.md">EXECUTION-STATE.md</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/VERIFIED-SOURCE.json">VERIFIED-SOURCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/r12-regression/LOCAL-TESTS.json">r12-regression/LOCAL-TESTS.json</a></li></ul><h4>后续精确关卡</h4><ol><li>PE已批准BODY、ECR两个精确key：由现有bucket authority读取对象详情及public-domain association，确认大小/摘要/大小写；若域名指向错误才提出有before/after的配置patch。当前未证明具体配置错误，不提出盲改、重传或purge。</li><li>ECR既有双语sourceProjection关系与新固定章节对应仍需内容owner证据；不按同坐标擅自合并。</li><li>复用PRIVATE_REPORTS及原权限/release owner的受控大PDF适配、模板身份及内存/流式验收；没有批准前继续BLOCKED。</li><li>七份回归生成证据恢复已完成并逐份校验；其他窗口新增修改继续保留。</li></ol><p>R2写/删0；生产配置变更0；生产D1写0；READ_ONLY移除0；Provider 0 / USD0；付款/退款0/0；commit/push/deploy均0。</p></div><p>证据恢复闭环：<a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/authorized-receipt-recovery/AUDIT.json">七份文件、起始状态、前后SHA及差异</a> · <a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/authorized-receipt-recovery/RESULT.json">7/7精确恢复结果</a> · <a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/authorized-receipt-recovery/BEFORE-DIFFS.log">恢复前逐文件diff</a>。备份及HEAD字节保留在同一 authorized-receipt-recovery 目录；不涉及产品源码，未重跑未受影响测试。</p><!-- R22-SUCCESSOR-END --></section><!-- REPORT-VISUAL-CONVERGENCE-R21:END --><!-- REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2:BEGIN --><section id="REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2" class="rvac"><style>.rvac{padding:24px;background:#f5f1e8;color:#17333e;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.rvac *{box-sizing:border-box}.rvac a{color:#086773}.rvac-table{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}.rvac table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.rvac th,.rvac td{padding:9px;border:1px solid #b9ad8a;text-align:left}.rvac-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr));gap:12px}.rvac img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.rvac figure{margin:0}.rvac code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><h1>REPORT-VISUAL-ASSET-CONVERGENCE-R2</h1><p>2026-10-26 · <strong>PARTIAL · HUMAN REVIEW</strong>。本地候选，未上线。固定图稿语言、客户内容语言与章节模式已分离。</p><p>报告内容按照您选择的语言生成；Personal Evidence 与 PHI Configuration 的封面及固定章节页统一采用中英双语版本。<br>Report content follows your selected language. Covers and fixed section pages for Personal Evidence and PHI Configuration use the shared bilingual edition.</p><h2>八类报告</h2><div class="rvac-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Report</th><th>Master sections</th><th>Fixed language</th><th>Readiness</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>BZR</td><td>DYNAMIC</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>VERIFIED</td></tr><tr><td>AST</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ZWR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>PROFILE</td><td>FIXED</td><td>BILINGUAL_SHARED</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>ECR</td><td>FIXED</td><td>BILINGUAL_SHARED</td><td>BLOCKED</td></tr><tr><td>NUM</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr><tr><td>HD</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr><tr><td>CROSS</td><td>FIXED</td><td>MATCH_APPROVED_LANGUAGE_VARIANT</td><td>PENDING</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>实际 R2 核对</h2><p>认证列举返回 HTTP401，完整清单仍 BLOCKED；没有续期或创建凭证。另核对81个现有登记精确key：46个解码成功、35个404。公共GET不是完整清单；404也不是新版本不存在的证明。</p><p>Personal Evidence旧目录全部失效，尚未找到新六页；ECR仅P01–P05确认，第六页与固定章节顺序未确认。AST有8张新字节匹配已知章节身份，旧SEC07/08地址404；Ziwei仅一张章首已确认，旧owner的S01/S02映射相互冲突。没有猜新文件名、复制双语对象、重建单语版本或更改历史冻结hash。</p><h2>实际 PDF 局部样张</h2><p><strong>以下是实际渲染的已确认页面子集，不是完整报告，不以标题中的“完整报告”图内文字宣称交付完成。</strong>固定页没有运行时标题、正文、数值、图表、客户姓名或页脚叠加；contain保持原比例。ECR客户正文样本复用原生合成报告owner，另页呈现。手机密集固定图内文字仍需放大，人审可读性尚待接受。</p><ul><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/astrology-confirmed-pages.pdf">astrology-confirmed-pages · PDF</a> — 13张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ziwei-confirmed-pages.pdf">ziwei-confirmed-pages · PDF</a> — 6张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-en.pdf">phi-configuration-en · PDF</a> — 5张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-zh-Hans.pdf">phi-configuration-zh-Hans · PDF</a> — 5张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li><li><a href="../../../../output/pdf/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-bilingual.pdf">phi-configuration-bilingual · PDF</a> — 5张固定图；完整报告 = NO</li></ul><p>Personal Evidence：未生成假图或替代PDF，保持BLOCKED。两类“前六页”均未宣称通过。ECR中英投影ID不同，缺同源绑定时不会合并成持久化双语客户报告。</p><div class="rvac-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/astrology-confirmed-pages-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/astrology-confirmed-pages-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 astrology-confirmed-pages"></a><figcaption>astrology-confirmed-pages · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ziwei-confirmed-pages-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/ziwei-confirmed-pages-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ziwei-confirmed-pages"></a><figcaption>ziwei-confirmed-pages · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-en-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-en-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 phi-configuration-en"></a><figcaption>phi-configuration-en · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-zh-Hans-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-zh-Hans-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 phi-configuration-zh-Hans"></a><figcaption>phi-configuration-zh-Hans · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-bilingual-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/phi-configuration-bilingual-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 phi-configuration-bilingual"></a><figcaption>phi-configuration-bilingual · 真实PDF页面缩略</figcaption></figure></div><h2>中英桌面与390px</h2><div class="rvac-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-en-1440.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-en-390.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-en-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-en-390.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png</figcaption></figure></div><h2>实际检查</h2><p>51项有界契约及负测通过，既有Profile120项回归、八字动态章节和package aliases通过，11项相关模块编译及实际Pages Functions Worker编译通过。五份PDF共37页；全部为局部样张。没有以这些结果替代20项完整验收。</p><div class="rvac-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Status</th><th>Actual boundary</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>T01</td><td>PASS</td><td>All eight architecture policies tested</td></tr><tr><td>T02</td><td>PASS</td><td>Existing BaZi dynamic publication test exits0; source/bindings unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>T03</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>AST eight confirmed image-only masters pass; SEC07/08 missing, full candidate blocked</td></tr><tr><td>T04</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Ziwei one confirmed master rendered; S01/S02 ownership/order unresolved; others old404</td></tr><tr><td>T05</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE Chinese source-content path retained; six real bilingual fixed pages not located</td></tr><tr><td>T06</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE English same; authenticated R2 request409 stores no incomplete artifact</td></tr><tr><td>T07</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE bilingual same; no fabricated PDF</td></tr><tr><td>T08</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR Chinese partial sample real; sixth page/section sequence absent</td></tr><tr><td>T09</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR English partial sample real; same five fixed asset keys</td></tr><tr><td>T10</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR bilingual comparison sample real, not a saved report; source locale binding also unresolved</td></tr><tr><td>T11</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR same confirmed keys across three modes passes; PROFILE policy passes but actual keys unavailable</td></tr><tr><td>T12</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Neither required six-page sequence has been proven; no invented P06</td></tr><tr><td>T13</td><td>PASS</td><td>All confirmed masters image-only; injected body ignored; content separated in unit contract; full completion not implied</td></tr><tr><td>T14</td><td>PASS</td><td>Missing/invalid/unapproved resources fail closed; no generated fallback</td></tr><tr><td>T15</td><td>PASS</td><td>NUM/HD/CROSS pending even though existing preliminary artwork exists</td></tr><tr><td>T16</td><td>PASS</td><td>Existing language policies retained; AST/Ziwei no unapproved locale fallback; BaZi regression passes</td></tr><tr><td>T17</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Five partial PDFs37pages pass A4/decode/no cropping; complete report visual acceptance remains blocked</td></tr><tr><td>T18</td><td>PASS</td><td>Commercial registry/prices/cost/entitlements byte-identical to HEAD</td></tr><tr