g-body-pages.pdf">ziwei-existing-body-pages · PDF</a> — 局部页集／摘录，非完整报告 · 4.11MiB</li></ul><p>这些大图PDF超过现有本地私有缓存1MiB限制；未解除该限制、未宣称生产签名交付已准入。原R1.2签名下载与撤销另行复跑通过。</p><div class="r21-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/profile-fixed-only-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/profile-fixed-only-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 profile-fixed-only"></a><figcaption>profile-fixed-only · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ast-native-fixed-and-body-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ast-native-fixed-and-body-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ast-native-fixed-and-body"></a><figcaption>ast-native-fixed-and-body · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ecr-body-bilingual-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ecr-body-bilingual-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ecr-body-bilingual"></a><figcaption>ecr-body-bilingual · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ziwei-existing-body-pages-pages.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/ziwei-existing-body-pages-pages.png" alt="实际PDF逐页 ziwei-existing-body-pages"></a><figcaption>ziwei-existing-body-pages · 真实逐页图</figcaption></figure></div><h2>手机／桌面与三语言</h2><p>PE／ECR三种内容语言共享同一套固定图key与字节；不强制双语正文。ECR中文、英文、双语BODY摘录实际渲染；PE因BODY不可读取，三语言完整PDF不作PASS。AST保留原获准双语正文模式，不擅自增加其他模式。</p><div class="r21-grid"><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/owner-inventory-followup/final-ecr-body-en-390.p