ns编译结果见下方运行记录，不使用整站build替代视觉验收。</p><p>继承runner恢复历史输出时发生UNKNOWN文件错误；七份生成证据文件变化已隔离列出。后获明确限定授权，逐份确认仅为运行时间／合成reading ID变化，备份并恢复至本轮开始的HEAD准确字节：7/7恢复、0跳过。原自动审批拒绝记录保留为历史。原历史测试与冻结hash未改。第二次120项运行将所有输出写入隔离目录，成功且不覆盖旧回执。</p><ul><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/ASSET-DELIVERY-MATRIX.json">ASSET-DELIVERY-MATRIX.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PUBLIC-DIAGNOSTICS.json">PUBLIC-DIAGNOSTICS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PRIVATE-DELIVERY.json">PRIVATE-DELIVERY.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PDF-INSPECTION-R22.json">PDF-INSPECTION-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/BROWSER-PDF-R22.json">BROWSER-PDF-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/TESTS-R22.json">TESTS-R22.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/R22-SOURCE-CHANGES.json">R22-SOURCE-CHANGES.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/REUSED-PDF-EVIDENCE.json">REUSED-PDF-EVIDENCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/PRESERVATION.json">PRESERVATION.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/RECEIPT-RECOVERY-STATUS.json">RECEIPT-RECOVERY-STATUS.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/CURRENT-WORKTREE.log">CURRENT-WORKTREE.log</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/EXECUTION-STATE.md">EXECUTION-STATE.md</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/VERIFIED-SOURCE.json">VERIFIED-SOURCE.json</a></li><li><a href="/tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/recovery-r22/r12-regression/LOCAL-TESTS.json">r12