-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-1440.png</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png"><img loading="lazy" src="../../../../tools/review/report-visual-asset-convergence-r2/final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png" alt="final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png"></a><figcaption>final-phi-configuration-zh-Hans-390.png</figcaption></figure></div><h2>实际检查</h2><p>51项有界契约及负测通过，既有Profile120项回归、八字动态章节和package aliases通过，11项相关模块编译及实际Pages Functions Worker编译通过。五份PDF共37页；全部为局部样张。没有以这些结果替代20项完整验收。</p><div class="rvac-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Status</th><th>Actual boundary</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>T01</td><td>PASS</td><td>All eight architecture policies tested</td></tr><tr><td>T02</td><td>PASS</td><td>Existing BaZi dynamic publication test exits0; source/bindings unchanged</td></tr><tr><td>T03</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>AST eight confirmed image-only masters pass; SEC07/08 missing, full candidate blocked</td></tr><tr><td>T04</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>Ziwei one confirmed master rendered; S01/S02 ownership/order unresolved; others old404</td></tr><tr><td>T05</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE Chinese source-content path retained; six real bilingual fixed pages not located</td></tr><tr><td>T06</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE English same; authenticated R2 request409 stores no incomplete artifact</td></tr><tr><td>T07</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>PROFILE bilingual same; no fabricated PDF</td></tr><tr><td>T08</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR Chinese partial sample real; sixth page/section sequence absent</td></tr><tr><td>T09</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR English partial sample real; same five fixed asset keys</td></tr><tr><td>T10</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR bilingual comparison sample real, not a saved report; source locale binding also unresolved</td></tr><tr><td>T11</td><td>BLOCKED</td><td>ECR sam